From 7e3107eece927d892aa8746e14e21b2c2850ec25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Talles Souza <tsxtalles@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:32:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Per-recipient tracked links, click attribution and DM
 sender username

Each DM link carries a signed ?t= naming the IGSID it was sent to; the redirect
records who clicked (LinkClick.recipientId/recipientName) and fills {username}
in the destination at click time, so a wa.me prefilled text can carry the @
behind a button. DM-only senders get their @ from the Instagram profile API.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
